下面这段代码的输出是什么？

```python
class Parent:
    def prn(self):
        print("Parent")


class Child(Parent):
    def __init__(self):
        self.a = Parent()

    def prn(self):
        print("Child")


temp = Child()
temp.a.prn()

```

